orm layout, and a laptop showing the package's Excel SOP compliance dashboard (bar charts and a donut chart). Do not redesign, simplify, recolor, or rebrand the box. SET & PROPS: Puskesmas disease control and environmental health room in the morning: a wall map of the service area with colored pins (no readable text), a shelf holding five binders of very different thickness with unreadable spine labels, a blue cool box on the floor, a desk with a laptop, window daylight, no other people. TIMELINE — 10 seconds: 0–2s Hook · close-up: five binders of very different thickness on a shelf (spine text unreadable); her hand pulls out the thinnest one; cut to medium shot as she looks to the camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "Binder klaster empat paling tipis." Delivery (EN): dry, honest 2–4s Problem · medium shot, she opens it: only a few loose pages inside. VO (ID, verbatim): "SK dan SOP-nya belum lengkap." Delivery (EN): concerned 4–6s Problem · medium close-up, she glances at the thick binders still on the shelf. VO (ID, verbatim): "Klaster lain sudah jauh rapi." Delivery (EN): quiet, uneasy 6–8s Problem · medium shot, she taps the wall map with colored pins. VO (ID, verbatim): "Padahal kegiatannya paling banyak di lapangan." Delivery (EN): firm 8–10s Beat · medium shot, she sets the thin binder on the desk and exhales. VO: none. AUDIO: Quiet room tone, a ceiling fan, a binder sliding off the shelf. Only the talent speaks. Natural Indonesian, conversational, clear pronunciation, no background music. Lighting/mood: realistic natural light matching the set, clean soft contrast, believable Indonesian setting, not glossy, not studio. Camera: follow the camera style above consistently; stable and restrained, no whip pans, no drone, no 360 orbit. Keep product readable whenever it is on screen. Performance: natural facial expression, believable professional UGC, natural eye contact, restrained gestures, no exaggerated acting. Lips clearly synced to each word. Hands: simple, natural, re